    {
      "source": "Returns the value of the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> of the underlying bean instance.",
      "translation": "返回底层 Bean 实例中给定<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>的值。",
