    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that will use an entity's\n<a href=\"../../annotation/PersistenceCreator.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>PersistenceCreator</code></a> to create a new instance of it to apply a new value\nfor a given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>. Will only be used if the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> is to be applied on a\ncompletely immutable entity type exposing an entity creator.",
      "translation": "一个<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>，它将使用实体上的<a href=\"../../annotation/PersistenceCreator.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>PersistenceCreator</code></a>注解来创建该实体的新实例，以便为给定的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>应用新值。仅当<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>将应用于一个完全不可变的实体类型，且该类型暴露了实体创建器时，才会使用此功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor</code></a> using the given delegate <code>accessorFunction</code> and\n<a href=\"EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>. <code>accessorFunction</code> is used to obtain a new <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>\nfor each property to set.",
      "translation": "使用给定的委托函数 `accessorFunction` 和 `<a href=\"EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>` 创建一个 `<a href=\"InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor</code></a>`。`accessorFunction` 用于为每个要设置的属性获取一个新的 `<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor</code></a> using the given delegate <code>accessorFunction</code> and\n<a href=\"EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的委托 `accessorFunction` 和 `<a href=\"EntityInstantiators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>EntityInstantiators</code></a>` 创建一个 `<a href=\"InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>InstantiationAwarePropertyAccessor</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to the given value. Will do type conversion if a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> is configured.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 设置为给定值。如果配置了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>，则执行类型转换。",
      "count": 1
    },
